# Federation registry (hub vaults only). Copy to .wiki-roots.tsv or use:
#   bash wiki/wiki-federate.sh register <name> <path-to-wiki> [--private]
#
# Columns (tab-separated): name <TAB> wiki-path <TAB> graph.json <TAB> flags
# - flags: "private" excludes the domain from the merged master graph (still its own vault).
#
# name        wiki-path                         graph.json                              flags
# projectA    /Users/me/code/projectA/wiki      /Users/me/code/projectA/wiki/graph/graph.json
# projectB    /Users/me/code/projectB/wiki      /Users/me/code/projectB/wiki/graph/graph.json
# finance     /Users/me/Desktop/finance/wiki    /Users/me/Desktop/finance/wiki/graph/graph.json   private
